# Deploy today — GCP · Dark Factory · studexmeat.com (ZTE-010)

Runbook: `docs/GCP_SETUP.md` + `docs/DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md` (GCP replaces Orgo)

## studexmeat.com (Shopify)

- [ ] Domains: www primary, SSL green
- [ ] Subscription selling plans on Tier 4 (and Studbot SKU if created)
- [ ] GCP verify API live; `STUDBOT_VERIFY_URL` set in host env (not git)
- [ ] Studbot unlock test with test subscriber email

## GCP platform

- [ ] Project + APIs enabled (Run, Secret Manager, Artifact Registry)
- [ ] Secrets: Shopify admin token, webhook secret
- [ ] Cloud Run `studbot-verify` deployed (africa-south1 or chosen region)
- [ ] DNS: verify.* → Cloud Run managed cert

## Dark Factory site

- [ ] Static host: `mission-control/factory/` on Firebase or Cloud Run
- [ ] Public URL 200 (factory.*)
- [ ] VM worker: clone repo, lab-mesh.env, Hermes gateway + tailscale serve 8642 (if VM up)
- [ ] Paperclip external invite for Dark Factory gateway (tailnet only)

## Client template (first GCP client)

- [ ] Separate project or folder named client-*
- [ ] No production secrets in Portable-agents git
- [ ] Document region + support contact in vault only